{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1000_p", "source_sha256": "177be374e42553664e805270eb3ce7acef0ec7ec73d115e5be21f04aa2fc4b4d", "ja": "（亜利沙との仕事帰り、急に雲行きが怪しくなった。\n劇場まであと少し。持ってくれるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（和亜利沙工作回来后，天色突然变得阴沉起来。\n离剧场已经没多远了。希望雨能撑住别下起来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5c99d827679997d3eb3fb63645e40a6bb90386171ecb491c9418f9cd419ce7e9", "ja": "亜利沙、少し急ごう。\nこの距離なら、濡れずに帰れるはず……", "zh": "亚利沙，我们稍微快一点吧。\n照这个距离，应该能在淋湿前回去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "9239afcb5ca1a6e41518fcabf9f999cf293b7faa86e6ed137b444f3e6591a43e", "ja": "ふっふっふ……\nついに！　来ました！　この時が！", "zh": "呼呼呼……\n终于！这个时刻来临了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8e4b5cf911e6238d039ef106eb4315b6a75a3978661aaddf07239ac60b9ebbef", "ja": "あ、亜利沙……？", "zh": "啊，亚利沙……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "ef98c9dc5b2f23207e0cd173bd2c86f8fe7adce52a5dcc04125bb3f24524d8ac", "ja": "ありさの新しい折りたたみ傘……\n激推しアイドルちゃんグッズの出番ですね～！！", "zh": "亚利沙的新折叠伞……\n最推偶像周边终于能派上用场了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "8373de92f35600fd2bf470e9891e645ff74deff76eece1487a5f097dc2ec9b37", "ja": "安心してください。ありさは布教用も常備しています！\nてことで、こちらは{$P$}さんに。", "zh": "请放心。亚利沙平时也常备着传教用的！\n所以说，这把就给{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1006_p", "source_sha256": "55adad90cefb24ea4d8636a160d6113e69b96b179f82c8cf972e184a38d54e76", "ja": "う、うん。ありがとう……。\n……そうだな。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。谢谢你……\n……也是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1007_p", "source_sha256": "807072d0dbd7621da174f53758a917fc6c64b0b8a75b8975ef6ac2b6b34b8a13", "ja": "なあ、亜利沙。使い心地を試したいから、\n少し遠回りしていいか？　今後の参考にしたいんだ。", "zh": "那个，亚利沙。为了试试用起来感觉怎么样，稍微绕点路可以吗？我想把这当作今后的参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "d9cbb8dee26a8b0c599c439355249ec8088c5eaa11ff14a04a4d8ccf95f6981b", "ja": "もちろんです～！　ありさも、\nこの傘を使う日をずっと楽しみにしてました！", "zh": "当然啦～！亚利沙也一直期待着用上这把伞的那天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0472_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0472_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "d6eae028d6807e9681496e12478f1937d3564b48b5c0b2f6509d430290cd8f87", "ja": "大好きなアイドルちゃんと一緒に過ごす雨の日……！\n毎日が楽しくなるのが、推し活のイイところですね♪", "zh": "和最喜欢的偶像一起度过的雨天……！\n能让每一天都变得开心，正是追星的好处呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
